<omdoc base="latin:/fundamentals/equality.omdoc"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#0.0.0:2922.76.0"/><meta property="http://cds.omdoc.org/?metadata?importedby"><om:OMOBJ xmlns:om="http://www.openmath.org/OpenMath"><om:OMLIT type="http://www.openmath.org/cd?OpenMath?OMSTR" value="mmt-omdoc"/></om:OMOBJ></meta></metadata><instruction text="namespace latin:/"/><instruction text="fixmeta http://cds.omdoc.org/urtheories?LF"/><mref name="[latin:/?UntypedEquality]" target="latin:/?UntypedEquality"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#37.4.0:58.4.21"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?UntypedEqualityND]" target="latin:/?UntypedEqualityND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#144.9.0:167.9.23"/></metadata></mref><opaque format="text"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#564.24.0:1013.29.0"/></metadata>A relative equality for a typed language, in which the equality of objects may depend on the type at which it is taken.
   This can be practical in connection with
   - record types: two records are equal if they agree in all fields required by the type
   - quotient types: equivalent representatives are equal if seen as elements of the quotient
   - forgetful functors and other implicit conversions: two different groups may be equal as sets</opaque><mref name="[latin:/?SoftTypedEquality]" target="latin:/?SoftTypedEquality"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#1015.30.0:1038.30.23"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?SoftTypedEqualityND]" target="latin:/?SoftTypedEqualityND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#1167.36.0:1192.36.25"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?TypedEquality]" target="latin:/?TypedEquality"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#1706.48.0:1725.48.19"/></metadata></mref><mref name="[latin:/?TypedEqualityND]" target="latin:/?TypedEqualityND"><metadata><link rel="http://cds.omdoc.org/mmt?metadata?sourceRef" resource="latin:/fundamentals/equality.mmt#1814.53.0:1835.53.21"/></metadata></mref></omdoc>